# OpenWeather API Configuration
# Get your free API key from: https://openweathermap.org/api
# 
# Uncomment and replace with your actual API key to enable live weather data
# Without this, the app will use mock data for development

# VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Example (do not use this key):
# VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=abc123def456ghi789jkl012mno345pqr

# Note: 
# - Free tier: 60 calls/minute, 1,000,000 calls/month
# - Keep this key secret - never commit to version control
# - For production, use environment variables from your hosting platform
